A sequence diagram's `%% stop:` comments tie messages to the stops that show
those lines.
-- base/a.go --
package a

func A() {}

func B() {}
-- head/a.go --
package a

func A() { B() }

func B() { println() }
-- review.md --
---
frame: map
---
# Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant a as A
  participant b as B
  a->>b: calls B
  %% stop: a.go:3-3
  b-->>a: returns
  %% stop: a.go:5-5
  %% stop: a.go:40-41
```

## A calls B

### a.go:3-3
